WEBVTT

00:00:29.378 --> 00:00:31.736
Ali večeras želim da počnem

00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:34.174
sugestijom da ova urbana kriza

00:00:34.174 --> 00:00:38.054
nije samo ekonomska ili ekološka.

00:00:38.054 --> 00:00:40.952
To je naročito kulturna kriza,

00:00:40.952 --> 00:00:43.837
kriza institucija

00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:47.573
nesposobnih da ponovo osmisle
glupe načine

00:00:47.573 --> 00:00:49.997
koje smo gajili,

00:00:49.997 --> 00:00:53.310
nesposobnih da postave izazov
gladi za naftom,

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:57.067
sebičnoj urbanizaciji
koja je ovekovečila

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:59.529
gradove zasnovane na potrošnji,

00:00:59.529 --> 00:01:04.960
od južne Kalifornije,
preko Njujorka, do Dubaija.